---
description: Session discipline — scope, verification, guardrails (Paxel-derived)
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at repo root before making changes.

1. Confirm scope: this repo only, one-sentence goal, what's out of scope.
2. Define success: a command or visible check before editing (not "check and test").
3. After redirects: re-state success check and run one verification before new work.
4. Auth/payments/keys: env only, never commit secrets; test login after auth changes.
